<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>PayloadType</key>
	<string>Configuration</string>
	<key>PayloadVersion</key>
	<integer>1</integer>
	<key>PayloadIdentifier</key>
	<string>io.github.studyreadbook4ever.howToSafeDNS</string>
	<key>PayloadUUID</key>
	<string>F78F4A58-04B1-5678-BDE7-2341F86E3568</string>
	<key>PayloadDisplayName</key>
	<string>howToSafeDNS · DNS4EU · DoT</string>
	<key>PayloadDescription</key>
	<string>This file contains a single DNS configuration only. It does not include a root certificate, VPN, device management enrollment or app installation. You can inspect the XML source on GitHub.

The profile is unsigned. “Unsigned” means it has no distributor signature; this is separate from the DNS connection's TLS encryption. Check the name and DNS addresses on the installation screen before deciding to install.

A free protective DNS service for individual users in Europe. It blocks malicious, phishing, command-and-control and court-ordered domains. In Korea, check connectivity and latency.

DNS4EU states that client IP addresses are fully anonymized before logging, and queries are not sold, profiled or used for advertising targeting. This does not mean that no logs exist.

Privacy policy: https://legal-documents-dns4eu.s3.fr-par.scw.cloud/DNS4EU-Public-DNS-Resolver-policy-2025.pdf</string>
	<key>PayloadScope</key>
	<string>System</string>
	<key>PayloadContent</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>PayloadType</key>
			<string>com.apple.dnsSettings.managed</string>
			<key>PayloadVersion</key>
			<integer>1</integer>
			<key>PayloadIdentifier</key>
			<string>io.github.studyreadbook4ever.howToSafeDNS.dns</string>
			<key>PayloadUUID</key>
			<string>A845A92A-882B-5C6E-841B-82AFC99E48EA</string>
			<key>PayloadDisplayName</key>
			<string>howToSafeDNS · DNS4EU · DoT</string>
			<key>DNSSettings</key>
			<dict>
				<key>DNSProtocol</key>
				<string>TLS</string>
				<key>ServerAddresses</key>
				<array>
					<string>86.54.11.1</string>
					<string>86.54.11.201</string>
					<string>2a13:1001::86:54:11:1</string>
					<string>2a13:1001::86:54:11:201</string>
				</array>
				<key>ServerName</key>
				<string>protective.joindns4.eu</string>
			</dict>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
